# One canonical form in the repository: text stored and checked out with LF, so a clone on Linux,
# macOS and Windows has the same bytes. Sidecar hashes of text files are normalised the same way
# (src/skmask/provenance.py), so a recorded hash does not depend on who cloned the repository.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
*.root binary
